{"id":"7745e9d0f7bd7f8e","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-gelfand-transform.md","title":"Gelfand Transform","display":"df-gelfand-transform — Gelfand Transform","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-gelfand-transform","aliases":["58-df-gelfand-transform"],"display":"df-gelfand-transform — Gelfand Transform","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-linear-functional.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-gelfand-transform"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-gelfand-transform</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gelfand-transform — Gelfand Transform"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"630c319f5a2106ce\" href=\"?note=630c319f5a2106ce\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md\">../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb6024478c28eefa\" href=\"?note=fb6024478c28eefa\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-linear-functional.md\">../batch04/58-df-linear-functional.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_A,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\in V\">\\(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_A,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"630c319f5a2106ce\" href=\"?note=630c319f5a2106ce\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md\">../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearFunctional}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearFunctional}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fb6024478c28eefa\" href=\"?note=fb6024478c28eefa\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-linear-functional.md\">../batch04/58-df-linear-functional.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Character}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Character}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GelfandTransform}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GelfandTransform}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}character}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Character}_S(\\varphi,A,+,\\cdot,1_A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearFunctional}_S(\\varphi,A,\\mathbb C)\n\\land\\varphi(1_A)=1\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(\\varphi(a\\cdot b)=\\varphi(a)\\varphi(b)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}character}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Character}_S(\\varphi,A,+,\\cdot,1_A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearFunctional}_S(\\varphi,A,\\mathbb C)\n\\land\\varphi(1_A)=1\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(\\varphi(a\\cdot b)=\\varphi(a)\\varphi(b)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}transform}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GelfandTransform}_S(\\Gamma,A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_A,\\Delta)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot b=b\\cdot a)\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot a=a=a\\cdot1_A)\n\\land\\Delta=\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathbb C^A:\\mathrm{Character}_S(\\varphi,A,+,\\cdot,1_A)\\}\n\\land\\Gamma:A\\to\\mathbb C^\\Delta\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Delta\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma(a)(\\varphi)=\\varphi(a)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}transform}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GelfandTransform}_S(\\Gamma,A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_A,\\Delta)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot b=b\\cdot a)\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot a=a=a\\cdot1_A)\n\\land\\Delta=\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathbb C^A:\\mathrm{Character}_S(\\varphi,A,+,\\cdot,1_A)\\}\n\\land\\Gamma:A\\to\\mathbb C^\\Delta\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Delta\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma(a)(\\varphi)=\\varphi(a)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For a commutative unital Banach algebra, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(a)\">\\(\\Gamma(a)\\)</span> is continuous on the character space with its weak-star topology.</li>\n<li>The Gelfand transform is an isometric isomorphism only for commutative unital <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^*\">\\(C^*\\)</span>-algebras; the former unqualified <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^*\">\\(C^*\\)</span> claim was false.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"630c319f5a2106ce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-linear-functional.md","status":"resolved","id":"fb6024478c28eefa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-linear-functional.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"630c319f5a2106ce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-linear-functional.md","status":"resolved","id":"fb6024478c28eefa","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearFunctional}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch04/58-df-linear-functional.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_A,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearFunctional}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Character}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GelfandTransform}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}character}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Character}_S(\\varphi,A,+,\\cdot,1_A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearFunctional}_S(\\varphi,A,\\mathbb C)\n\\land\\varphi(1_A)=1\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(\\varphi(a\\cdot b)=\\varphi(a)\\varphi(b)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}transform}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GelfandTransform}_S(\\Gamma,A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_A,\\Delta)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot b=b\\cdot a)\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot a=a=a\\cdot1_A)\n\\land\\Delta=\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathbb C^A:\\mathrm{Character}_S(\\varphi,A,+,\\cdot,1_A)\\}\n\\land\\Gamma:A\\to\\mathbb C^\\Delta\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Delta\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma(a)(\\varphi)=\\varphi(a)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma(a)","display":false},{"tex":"C^*","display":false},{"tex":"C^*","display":false}],"bytes":1749,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-579","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-gelfand-transform.md|58-df-gelfand-transform]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["630c319f5a2106ce","fb6024478c28eefa","36d7463d215be751"]}